{"id":"01f4b76e2e096590","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","title":"Isomorphism","display":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-isomorphism","Isomorphic","Isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-isomorphism</span><span>Isomorphic</span><span>Isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}, \\mathcal{B}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}, \\mathcal{B}\\)</span> (structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(A=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (underlying sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (common first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (constant, function, and relation symbols of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> and the corresponding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>-interpretations (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (structure predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span> (isomorphism predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijective predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\\left(f(I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))=I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\right)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\left(f(I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(g)(\\bar a))=I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(g)(f\\circ\\bar a)\\right)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\left(\\bar a\\in I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\\left(f(I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))=I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\right)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\left(f(I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(g)(\\bar a))=I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(g)(f\\circ\\bar a)\\right)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\left(\\bar a\\in I^{\\mathcal A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in I^{\\mathcal B}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\mathcal{A} \\cong_{\\mathcal L} \\mathcal{B} \\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\mathcal{A} \\cong_{\\mathcal L} \\mathcal{B} \\leftrightarrow \\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Isomorphism: bijective structure-preserving map</li>\n<li>Elementary equivalence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A} \\equiv \\mathcal{B}\">\\(\\mathcal{A} \\equiv \\mathcal{B}\\)</span> iff same first-order theory</li>\n<li>Partial isomorphism: back-and-forth preserving finite tuples</li>\n<li>Back-and-forth argument: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A} \\cong \\mathcal{B}\">\\(\\mathcal{A} \\cong \\mathcal{B}\\)</span> for countable atomic models</li>\n<li>Categoricity: one model up to isomorphism</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)$ and $B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)$ (underlying sets, see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{